      "description": "Pipe material, normalised here from the raw Materials field. That field mixes the service's wMainMaterial domain labels with the same domain's raw codes and with free text appended by staff, so the same material appears under several spellings. Codes are expanded using that published domain and a trailing Domestic / Irrigation / Abandoned qualifier is removed. Raw Materials is retained unchanged alongside this column."
